s) Winter is impending,<br /> the Inanimae are waking up<br /> the Fomorians are rising,<br /> the Adhene are coming to Earth<br /> war on Concordia/Discordia<br /> the last Sidhe Houses come back to Earth, leaving <i>someone</i> in Arcadia &quot;holding down the fort&quot;...<br /> <br /> ... and?<br /> the ToJ Endless Winter (with a lot of interesting ideas for the end of a Changeling chronicle but without actually explaining much).<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> there's anything else before the ToJ?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> who are the Fomorians (splat-like)? what are they doing or even aiming (as factions)? why the Fomorians' Green Court surrendered undefeated?<br /> most importantly, what's happening in Arcadia? why the first 8 Houses were driven to Earth? and why the other 5 Houses joined them?<br /> <br /> and... a lot more... -__-<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T11:09:19-08:00","id":322982,"title":"","content":"The only thing you're really missing is the disappearance of the High King, but you might be including that in Concordia's civil war.<br /> <br /> There's no published answer to why the Green Court surrendered. That is the mystery of the ages.<br /> <br /> The prevailing thought by the sidhe on Earth is that the original resurgence was because the houses were exiled from Arcadia. Once the gate between worlds was opened, they were given the boot. This is what they've managed to piece together from vague memories, dreams, omens, and gut feelings. Thanks to the mists, no one has clear memories of what happened in Arcadia. If I recall correctly, there are some sidhe who dispute the consensus about the houses being exiled.<br /> <br /> It's been awhile since I've read Book of Lost Houses, so I may be misremembering. I believe the other houses joined them on Earth because they determined that the only way to save Arcadia was on Earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T11:10:44-08:00","id":322986,"title":"","content":"Those are actually some pretty good questions. I hope someone with more knowledge can shed some light.<br /> I'm especially seeking info on the fomorians cause i don't think they have clear mechanics as far as i know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/530-bloodspeaker","name":"Bloodspeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar530_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T11:26:55-08:00","id":322995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bloodspeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/322963-changeling-the-dreaming-i-think-i-m-missing-something-metaplot-spoiler?p=322986#post322986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those are actually some pretty good questions. I hope someone with more knowledge can shed some light.<br /> I'm especially seeking info on the fomorians cause i don't think they have clear mechanics as far as i know.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect this is because of the power level they and the Tuatha de Danaan were portrayed at - even prior to the Changeling Way, they are presented as above and beyond the other fae, their effective god-figures.<br /> <br /> We know what the Fomorians are in conceptual terms: they are the darkness in humanity given form, and the only way to truly defeat them would be to eradicate that darkness.<br /> <br /> Denizens of the Dreaming is, as of this point, our chief source for the information we have on them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":".  Spelling 11-27-2014, 01:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T11:30:56-08:00","id":322997,"title":"","content":"Yes, the Formorians occupy the same spot in Changeling: The Dreaming as the Antediluvians in Vampire: The Masquerade. They're better expressed as concepts and plot devices than as PCs and splats the game mechanics can interface with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T13:54:00-08:00","id":323148,"title":"","content":"I see thanks for the answers guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/530-bloodspeaker","name":"Bloodspeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar530_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T14:23:50-08:00","id":323169,"title":"","content":"To borrow a little from outside of CTD but firmly from the Source Material that inspired it, the Three Formorian Courts (Red, White and Green) are the Fomori Houses of War, Magic and Politics of the old old legends from Ireland. The Red Court is Humanity's dreams of conquering, bloodshed and genocide given nightmarish form, the White Court is everything that humanity has ever feared in &quot;magical&quot; form and the Green Court is humanity's ability to lie and deceive made manifest. Equally they are the ever present forces of these concepts that existed before humanity's dreams too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}